{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"tools":[{"name":"execute_blender_code","description":"Execute ordinary read-only bpy/Python in this session persistent private Blender namespace. NumPy, mathutils BVH, mesh/triangle reading, your own Python computations and cached variables are allowed. Only this scene and your own computations may be read; no fixture sources, management files or scoring data. No scene edits or saving. Image delivery disabled.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string"}},"required":["code"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"human_eye_scene_observe","description":"Current Blender facts. Directory query={mode:directory} with include_image=false returns tight evaluated world bounds, AABB centers and an independent directory binding. Task set example: {\"include_image\":false,\"query\":{\"mode\":\"task\",\"target\":{\"name\":\"A\"},\"candidates\":[{\"name\":\"B\"}],\"requested_facts\":[\"closed_solid_relation\",\"surface_proximity\"]}}. Opt in to spatial_relation and surface_proximity for support-certified separation with closed-classification fallback. Unknown/duplicate rows remain. Complete penetration/nearest-separated sets require all relevant evidence; otherwise only known subsets are reported. Legacy objects pair/aabb supported. Global surface_nearest instead uses one query.objects selector without focal_id, or focal_id with query={\"mode\":\"surface_nearest\"}; session_id and include_image=false required. Complete means global nearest; partial means best-known. scene_revision/fingerprint bind this capture/source/revision; runtime_source_sha256 identifies code. Scene edits expire observations. Goals are caller criteria.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"task_instruction":{"type":"string"},"focal_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"reference_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"session_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"goal":{"type":"object","description":"Optional caller-supplied task criteria, ev